cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TerrainGen for published research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TerrainGen: An open-source scientific terrain generation suite for planetary surfaces"
abstract: >-
  A C++ and Python library, with a command-line tool, for generating scientific terrain of
  planetary surfaces: crater and rock populations from published size-frequency distributions,
  crater profiles and degradation, and albedo, on synthetic or measured elevation models.
authors:
  - family-names: Maietta
    given-names: Alex
repository-code: "https://github.com/alexmaietta/terraingen"
url: "https://alexmaietta.github.io/terraingen/"
license: BSD-3-Clause
version: 0.2.0
keywords:
  - terrain
  - moon
  - mars
  - craters
  - planetary science
  - simulation
